      "id": 10570,
      "name": "MigrantP",
      "username": "MigrantP",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-24T16:03:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks! That's how we played it.</p><p>I thought it was really interesting that you are allowed to play Boost cards at the end of phases, before the start of the next phase. For example, playing a card you just drew in Aftermath before the Travel phase begins. That can be very useful, and definitely is not apparent from the regular rulebook.</p>",
